summary: Print a workspace's message log, oldest first

!! Reference

```
Print a workspace's message log, oldest first

Usage: mf gui messages [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>
          Workspace id (default: the focused workspace)

      --last <LAST>
          Only the newest N entries

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
